  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "真正改变你的，往往不是大事",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 2656,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "只是落在桌面上",
      "startMs": 2727,
      "endMs": 4330,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒新的一天开始",
      "startMs": 4400,
      "endMs": 6598,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "人这一生",
      "startMs": 6668,
      "endMs": 7951,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "真正改变命运的",
      "startMs": 8021,
      "endMs": 9692,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "很少是惊天动地的决定",
      "startMs": 9763,
      "endMs": 11572,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "更多是每个普通早晨",
      "startMs": 11642,
      "endMs": 13840,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "你愿不愿重新整理自己",
      "startMs": 13910,
      "endMs": 16155,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "把该做的做好",
