      "endMs": 17622,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "把不该背的放下",
      "startMs": 17692,
      "endMs": 19547,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "不羡慕别人的季节",
      "startMs": 19617,
      "endMs": 21678,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "也不否认自己的迟到",
      "startMs": 21748,
      "endMs": 23488,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "只要还在往前走",
      "startMs": 23558,
      "endMs": 25299,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "就没有真正的晚",
      "startMs": 25369,
      "endMs": 27361,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "按自己的速度成长",
